@page "/transaktionen"

<PageTitle>Transactions</PageTitle>

<h1>Transaction Inspector</h1>

<p class="text-muted">
    Running and completed upload/download transactions with raw XML, decrypted OrderData
    and return codes — plus the global, unfiltered log view across all customers
    (operator/developer view, including internal events). It shows the state of
    <em>this</em> process (sample data), not that of a separately started emulator.
</p>

@* Static-SSR page with one interactive island (ADR-0009: render mode at the embedding site).
   The island reads in-process through the ITransactionInspectorProvider (EBICO.Server stores). *@
<TransactionInspector @rendermode="InteractiveServer" />
